[{ "action": "append", "id": "event-modals", "value" : "<div tabindex=\"-1\" id=\"modal-7e48580a-32bc-4262-b1fe-5c469787b1d9\" class=\"modal\"><div class=\"modal-dialog modal-lg\"><div class=\"modal-content\"><div class=\"modal-header\"><a data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"close\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span></a><p class=\"text-muted\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-road\"></span> Research Track</p><strong>Wed 15 Apr 2026 17:00 - 17:15 at <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/room/icse-2026/icse-2026-venue-oceania-iv\" class=\"room-link navigate\">Oceania IV</a></strong> - <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/track/icse-2026/icse-2026-research-track#program\" class=\"navigate\">Human and Social Aspects 5</a> <small>Chair(s): <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/carolynseaman\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\">Carolyn Seaman</a></small></div><div class=\"modal-body\"><div class=\"bg-primary event-title\"><h4><span data-event-star=\"7e48580a-32bc-4262-b1fe-5c469787b1d9\" title=\"Add event to your program\"><span class=\"text-disabled glyphicon glyphicon-star-empty\"></span></span><strong>TaCoS: Generated Context Summaries for Task Resumption</strong></h4></div><div class=\"bg-info event-description\"><p>Interruptions are a frequent challenge in software development, requiring developers to reconstruct both the mental and working context of their tasks. While prior work has proposed visual timelines or manual notes to aid resumption, these approaches either require effort or lack support for mental context reconstruction. Recent advances in large language models (LLMs) offer new opportunities to support task resumption through automatically generated summaries. We present TaCoS, an IDE-integrated tool that generates task context summaries from IDE and browser activity, combining inferred intent, implementation steps, and links to relevant artifacts. We evaluated TaCoS in a controlled lab study with 32 software developers who resumed three programming tasks. Each task was resumed using one of three cues: a manual note, a timeline of recent edits, or a TaCoS-generated summary. The generated summary led to the shortest resumption and edit lag, and was rated as the most helpful cue overall. However, the timeline condition achieved the highest task success rate. Participants valued the summaries\u2019 structured, low-effort presentation of past activity, but noted that they often lacked forward-looking information, which was typically present in the self-authored manual notes. These findings highlight the potential of combining automated summarization with lightweight user annotations to support task resumption in development environments.</p>\n<p></p><p></p><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/alexanderlill\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Alexander Lill\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/alexanderlill/6c96db1f-ec9d-472b-a93e-35b0ce13a543/micro-avatar?1783977293000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Alexander Lill<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">University of Zurich</span></h5></div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/valentinhollenstein\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"micro-avatar\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getDefaultImage/micro-avatar?1783985080000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Valentin Hollenstein<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">University of Zurich</span></h5></div></div></a></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/royrutishauser\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Roy Rutishauser\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/royrutishauser/fc6ff65d-4207-4dae-be02-ae2e4a9b1d97/micro-avatar?1783979765000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Roy Rutishauser<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">University of Zurich</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>Switzerland</small></h5></div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/andrenmeyer\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Andr&eacute; N. Meyer\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/andrenmeyer/4c15e8ed-ba2c-45e0-a963-5f4066a03bd2/micro-avatar?1783977513000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Andr\u00E9 <span class=\"name-visual-sep\"></span>N. Meyer<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">University of Zurich</span></h5></div></div></a></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/thomasfritz\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Thomas Fritz\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/thomasfritz/7c80e079-5a90-4570-983f-af44b08e1302/micro-avatar?1783980428000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Thomas Fritz<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">University of Zurich</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>Switzerland</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div></div><br></div><div class=\"modal-footer\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/details/icse-2026/icse-2026-research-track/184/TaCoS-Generated-Context-Summaries-for-Task-Resumption\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-new-window\"></span> All Details</a></span><a href=\"#\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"btn btn-default\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span> Close</a></div></div></div></div>"},{ "action": "runscript", "value": "$('#modal-7e48580a-32bc-4262-b1fe-5c469787b1d9').modal({ backdrop: 'static', keyboard: true}, 'show');" },
